1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,950
One day, Abba Gebre Hanna was walking
alone along the road.

2
00:00:05,950 --> 00:00:10,820
As he walked, he met a man carrying food
on the road.

3
00:00:10,820 --> 00:00:16,830
Abba Gebre Hanna greeted him and asked,
"Where are you going?"

4
00:00:16,830 --> 00:00:23,780
The man replied, "I am taking food to my
family while they thresh the grain."

5
00:00:23,780 --> 00:00:29,550
The aroma of the wrapped meal drifted
through the warm air.

6
00:00:29,550 --> 00:00:37,550
"I was sent for it myself," he said
calmly. "Let me take it to them."

7
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:43,520
Trusting him, the man handed over the food
and turned back.

8
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:51,000
Stepping into the shade, Abba Gebre Hanna
ate the entire meal himself.

9
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:57,020
Then, just as calmly as before, he
continued on his way.
